      {
        "index": 5,
        "name": "What Kami Do: Scavenging",
        "description": "MENU: \u201c$MUSU isn\u2019t the only thing the Kamigotchi will collect.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cOver time, the Harvesting action generates a force that draws objects and items to the Kami.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cIt\u2019s like a kind of magnetism that only affects certain things.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cWhich things? Well that depends on your Kami\u2019s location. You can see what items a kami might find in a room by checking the room details on my harvesting screen.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cWe call this action \u201cScavenging\u201d.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cTry it out and see what kind of present the Kami brings you!\u201d\nMENU: \u201cOnce you\u2019ve collected it, I can cross reference it with my database to see if the drop tables I\u2019ve been giving you are accurate.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cI\u2019ll be pretty embarrassed if they\u2019re wrong too, but there\u2019s only one way to find out.\u201d",
