        "description": "MENU: \u201cThe \u201cEerie\u201d type comes into being when the normal state of things gets changed by something divine or supernatural.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cIf you ask me, this entire world is a little bit eerie, but there\u2019s places where that effect is heightened enough for it to be the main influence on the local environment.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cBy comparing the items from an eerie room to ones from a normal room, we might be able to chart out how this world has been changed.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cCollect three scavenges from eerie type rooms and let\u2019s see what turns up.\u201d",
