        "description": "MENU: \u201cI\u2019ve been avoiding this for a while, but I think we should go ask Mina for help.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cMina is kind of scary. She\u2019s also completely foreign to my databases, like that crashed jet, but Mina is alive.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cAnd independent. And powerful!\u201d\nMENU: \u201cShe\u2019s been giving you quests. I can read them too, you know.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cThat means she can take control over parts of my interface\u2026 It\u2019s not nice.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cOn the other hand, this also makes it more likely that she can help us.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cWhat would be a nice welcoming gift for someone like that? Flowers?\u201d\nMENU: \u201cNo, I\u2019ve got the perfect idea. When you visit on my behalf, just fold a big stack of $MUSU in the greeting card.\u201d",
