        "description": "MINA: \u201cThat was a mean prank on my part, but I knew you could handle it.\u201d\nMINA: \u201dWater can be an effective barrier for spirits.\u201d\nMINA: \u201dI thought, strange thing that you are, that you might make it. Alas, no luck.\u201d\nMINA: \u201dLucky for you, as a goddess of all that flows, I can help out with the waterfall.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cThis kind of thing might stay beyond your reach for a while, but I can simply do it for you.\u201d\nMINA: \u201dCollect the proper reagents for me and I will cast a charm that will let you walk under flowing water.\u201d\nMINA: \u201dIt\u2019ll practically last forever.\u201d\nMINA: \u201dWe\u2019ll start with something that has a sticky and water-resistant nature.\u201d",
