      {
        "index": 36,
        "name": "The Sanctuary Caves",
        "description": "MINA: \u201cI\u2019ll be scrying you while you explore. I\u2019m not coming in myself, but I\u2019ll be watching closely.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cI can still send you messages through Menu when I need favors done.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cBetween you and me, Mina seems excited.\u201d\u00a0\nMENU: She doesn\u2019t show it like I do, but when it comes to not knowing the whole story, she gets just as frustrated.\u00a0\nMINA: \u201cI just said I\u2019d be scrying you. That means watching and listening.\u201d\u00a0\nMINA: \u201cBut yes. I\u2019m hoping to get some of my own questions answered inside.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cFor me, it\u2019s personal. I used to know things and someone took them away from me.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cNot only do I want to restore my data on the caves, I want to know who did this to me and why.\u201d\nMENU: \u201dThen you can have your Kami eat them, I guess.\u201d",
