      {
        "index": 37,
        "name": "Into the Depths",
        "description": "MENU: \u201cThis cave system is much larger than my scans from the surface seemed to imply.\u201d\nMENU:\u00a0 \u201cI know this is exactly what we were looking for, but this place\u2026it intimidates me.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cNot getting cold feet now are you dear? I, for one, remain quite intrigued by these caverns.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cFrom what my initial scrying has revealed, I suspect they will contain many valuable resources.\u201d\u00a0\nMINA: \u201cPerhaps even some clues relating to those garish looking office buildings outside.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cIs that not what you\u2019re here to discover?\u201d\nMENU: \u201cYeah, you\u2019re right Mina. Sorry for being weird.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cWe won\u2019t know more until we collect more data, so you know what to do.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cGet your kami harvesting and let's see what turns up.\u201d",
