      {
        "index": 38,
        "name": "Feeling in the Dark",
        "description": "MINA: \u201cI was just thinking. At long last, I got you to take a shower.\u201d\nMINA: \u201c...\u201d\nMENU: \u201c...\u201d\nMINA: \u201c...\u201d\nMENU: \u201cMina please.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cFine, fine, just let me review the results of my latest scry, be patient.\u201d\nMINA: \u201c...\u201d\nMINA: \u201cI can see where your headache came from.\u201d\u00a0\nMINA: \u201cSomeone has been treating the sacred grounds of your distant forebears like it\u2019s free real estate.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cI don\u2019t know if you should really consider me related to them. Weren\u2019t these temples made by humans?\u201d\nMINA: \u201cOf course they were. Why would that\u2026?\u201d\nMINA: \u201cAh..I see, of course. My mistake.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cSo anyway, do you think whoever messed with this place is connected to the labs?\u201d\nMINA: \u201cWell, Since that is presently our only and most likely lead, we can proceed from the assumption that they are, at least for now.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cWe won\u2019t know more until we investigate the depths of their desecration.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cOperator, have your kami scavenge around and we\u2019ll see what they have wrought.\u201d",
