        "description": "MINA: \u201cIn the underground lake at the bottom of these caves, you can find lotus flowers of uncommon size.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cDo you see how their blossoms are shaped? Those shapes create eddies in the $MUSU currents.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cIf you remember your lessons, you\u2019ll know that means they\u2019re a potential source of sensory essences.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cIt\u2019s pretty strange to find two different essences so close to each other.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cSomeone probably cultivated them here so they could get the whole set.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cHave your Kami scavenge some essence of smell for us, but be careful, it\u2019s a bit volatile.\u201d",
