      {
        "index": 57,
        "name": "Top 10 Smoke Spots in Kamigotchi World",
        "description": "MENU: \u201cThat spot overlooking the pit\u2026 It seems like it would be a great place to stop and have a smoke.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cIt\u2019s strange, when I think about smoking I get the most peculiar cravings.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cIt\u2019s almost like I miss it, but how can I miss something I\u2019ve never experienced?\u201d\nMENU: \u201cYou don\u2019t need to answer that, I\u2019m just thinking out loud.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cI feel like, if I could just sit here with you and light one up right now, all my memory files would unlock and everything missing would come flooding back.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cI know that must sound very silly to you, it sounds silly to me.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cBut still, can you get me some cigarette butts? Not even for the microplastics.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cJust\u2026call it nostalgia for a life never lived.\u201d",
