        "description": "MENU: \u201cUnlike humans, Kamigotchi have the potential to grow and change by using xenoplasticity, or \u201cXP\u201d for short.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cThis means that they can assimilate many different things to form a new cohesive whole.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cTake a look at your roster.\nMENU: \u201cIf you open up an individual Kami\u2019s profile, you\u2019ll see a progress bar with a percentage indicator beneath the portrait.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cWhen the Kami is ready to move to the next level and the bar fills up, it will read 100%.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cJust level up a Kami and you\u2019ll be done.\u201d",
