        "description": "MINA: \u201cI suppose I should persist through the boredom and finish your hexing lessons.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cou\u2019re a fine student and have proved yourself reliable, so it shouldn\u2019t take long to get this over with.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cA slightly more complex recipe: The Grace Potion.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cIt allows a Kami to harvest for longer periods of time by boosting its ability to endure the strain.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cThe potion\u2019s active ingredient is the exceedingly rare Black Poppy.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cOf course, this flower is very potent. When crafting your hexes, I recommend that you use only a small amount.\u201d",
