        "description": "ROB: \u201cI don\u2019t know about you, but I\u2019ve been smellin\u2019 sulfur in the air.\u201d\nROB: \u201cCould be somethin\u2019 bad. But I got somethin\u2019 else on my mind about it.\u201d\nROB: \u201cIt\u2019s makin\u2019 me think about eggs. Haven\u2019t had an egg for about a thousand years.\u201d \nROB: \u201cHell, but I\u2019m never gonna get tired of usin\u2019 that for an excuse.\u201d\nROB: \u201cIf you get your hands on a fried egg, give it here. I\u2019m beggin\u2019 for one.\u201d\nROB: \u201cDon\u2019t even care if it\u2019s spoiled.\u201d",
