        "name": "Danger Lies Ahead\u2026",
        "description": "MENU: \u201cHey hold up here for a second, don\u2019t go further into world yet.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cSee the vending machine over there? It\u2019s something like a standing stone.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cOperators like you can use it to summon new kami into existence. Pretty neat huh?\u201d\nMENU: \u201cBut listen, the area we\u2019ve been exploring so far, between the river and the vending machine? It\u2019s basically the entrance to this world.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cThe ambient energy of the area is rather weak and only supports the deployment of kami of up to level 15.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cAs a result, it\u2019s safe from high level predators.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cBut if you go further, you will leave that region of relative safety.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cSteel yourself operator, many dangers lie ahead.\u201d",
