        "description": "MENU: \u201cI should mention something important.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cThe are we\u2019ve been in so far is something like a safe zone.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cThe ambient energy of the area is pretty weak, so it can only support the deployment of kami that are less than level 15.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cBut the further down this path you go the denser and more powerful the local energies will become.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cThat means a high level predator could decide to snack on your kami if you go too far.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cJust thought I\u2019d give you the heads up.\u201d",
