        "description": "MENU: \u201cThe dowsing rod is picking something up again.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cI don\u2019t get it. There\u2019s nothing here but decay.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cHmm.\u201d\nMINA:\u201d The flora of the underworld thrives on decay, but the rod\u2019s reaction is curious\u2026\u201d\nMINA: \u201cThis may be something more than mere spiritual corruption.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cHarvest here for a while, I\u2019ll look into it further.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cYou should hope that I\u2019m mistaken, unlikely an occurrence as that may be.\u201d",
