        "description": "MENU: \u201cThe dowsing rod is picking something up? Here?\u201d\nMINA: \u201cDoes that surprise you?\u201d\nMINA: \u201cThe mundane and modern aesthetic of these structures is what\u2019s truly out of place here.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cThe presence of some alien vastness within them is to be expected.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cI mean\u2026 It\u2019s weird for sure. I guess I just hadn\u2019t thought about what that would mean for the local energy.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cFor me, that\u2019s a strange oversight to make.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cIt might be the result of the tampering that was done to me.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cSet your Kami harvesting in here for a while, Operator. I\u2019ll run some more scans.\u201d",
