      {
        "index": 3107,
        "name": "Look Who\u2019s Talking",
        "description": "MENU: \u201cThe skeleton here doesn\u2019t look very comfortable.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cWill it really start talking?\u201d\nMENU: \u201c\u2026\u201d\nWET BONES: \u201cYou don\u2019t look like anyone I know. Everyone I know I don\u2019t like.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cAh!\u201d\nWET BONES: \u201cClosest ones are the furthest away. No trust between us. Not like that.\u201d\nWET BONES: \u201cNeed to take a breath, but there\u2019s no air. Nothing real here.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cIt\u2019s like he can see you, but he\u2019s just kind of saying things.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cDoesn\u2019t seem like he can hear me, either. He\u2019s really dissociated.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cI feel bad, I really thought he was just part of the background.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cBut if he\u2019s stressed and needs to take a breath\u2026\u201d\nMENU: \u201cI\u2019ve got a crazy idea.\u201d",
