        "description": "MENU: \u201cThis one has been bugging me for a long time. Even more after we got that chip.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cCall out with that fancy ring of yours.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cMaybe this skeleton will finally have something to chatter about.\u201d\nMENU: \u201c\u2026\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cHoly shit, you look scary!\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cYou\u2019re going to swallow my soul, right? I don\u2019t deserve it!\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cIt\u2019s love! I wasn\u2019t doing anything wrong!\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cWait, you aren\u2019t after me? Yeah, that\u2019s what I mean, I\u2019m innocent.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cHe doesn\u2019t sound innocent.\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cSay, you know, I actually lost something around here.\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cIt\u2019s this screwdriver with a red handle. It has an \u2018A\u2019 on it, maybe.\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cCan you get it for me?\u201d",
