        "description": "MENU: \u201cThe Lost Skeleton has been crying out for you.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cBy the way, I really don\u2019t like that I can hear them, but they can\u2019t hear me.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cAt first, I liked that I could whisper to you in private, sure.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cBut now, it feels like I\u2019m not really here.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cAnyway. He says he\u2019s curious if any other employees left stuff behind.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cThere\u2019s that campsite in the caves, remember?\u201d\nMENU: \u201cGo dig around there, maybe you\u2019ll turn something up.\u201d",
