        "name": "See the Glass as Half Full",
        "description": "MINA: \u201cMy large old friend in the caves has surely lost all but his body.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cAnd I have of course accepted his loss and had you pay respects on my behalf.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cBut a part of me remains hopeful.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cAnd another part, curious if some spiritual parasite might have taken residence in his corpse.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cPlease take some time here and call out with the Kami at your side.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cIf only as a favor to me.\u201d",
