        "name": "Airing it Out",
        "description": "MINA: \u201cYou\u2019ve found two lost souls so far. Both are quite talkative.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cAnd they\u2019re real scatterbrains.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cThe poor Wet Bones has less focus than the Lost Skeleton.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cI\u2019d like to try something with that one. It might help.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cFirst, move to the Insect Node in the forest and meditate with your Kami. Take a long time.\u201d\nMINA: \u201cThis should briefly tint your aura with the corruption and decay of the Insect type.\u201d\nMENU: \u201cSo that when you talk to the Bones next, you seem like a lost soul too?\u201d\nMINA: \u201cExactly.\u201d",
