        "name": "Trash Pickers",
        "description": "MINA: \u201cGo on. Now that you\u2019ve got his attention, see what he wants.\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cYou\u2019re back, huh? I knew you wanted to be friends.\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cWe\u2019re not so different, huh? We want the same stuff probably.\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cYou helped me find out some stuff about Arawn, right?\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cSo you must also be curious. Help me pin these people down and we all get ahead.\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cIf there\u2019s a road to the labs, people walked it, right? Go pick up litter.\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cDigging through trash, that\u2019s how you really get to know people.\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cNot just the kinda cigarettes they smoke or what they like to eat, either.\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cSometimes they gotta downsize. They get rid of something important, but not too important.\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cFamily photos, maybe they don\u2019t like those people anymore.\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cMaybe some paperwork they forgot to shred.\u201d\nLOST SKELETON: \u201cNot saying you\u2019ll get much here. Haha.\u201d",
